<title>JAPAN: Toyo Umpanki says 96/97 earnings to top forecast.</title>
<headline>Toyo Umpanki says 96/97 earnings to top forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Machinery maker Toyo Umpanki Co Ltd said on Wednesday that its earnings for the business year to March 31, 1997 would be slightly better than the forecast it announced in May, due to robust demand for its new products.</p>
</text>
